Subject: [PATCH 1/5] chore: raise the binary size ceiling to 50.5 MB

Hover help needs about 170 KB on windows/amd64, the largest target,
where main has 84,096 bytes of room. Most of it is code that draws and
walks the explainer and its function table, so it fits only by
dropping features. docs/perf.md records the raise and the reason.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
